      "content": "it's just that the nothingness feels so much more honest than my actual life. like, everything i do in the real world feels performative and fake, but this heaviness... it's the only thing that feels real. i've been thinking about how much more profound it would be to actually lean into that feeling, instead of just writing about it. to make the art match the void.",
